<topic id="GUID-BC816C0F-3977-4D39-A6F7-B58E2D4678CA" xml:lang="en-US"> 
  <title>BIOS Requirements</title> 
  <body> 
    <ol id="GUID-5C46D1AF-044A-4807-8FB6-0CB43FACB0F9">
      <li> BIOS need to program the Stolen memory region ( DSM, GSM, PAVP, GGC) and BDF register in DE.
      </li>
      <li>BIOS should initialize the supported CDCLK and Power well flow:
        <ul id="GUID-6DD17CD0-7E2E-4651-ADCF-BBFF864982A3">
          <li>PG Flow
          </li>
          <li> CDCLK
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li> 
    </ol>
  </body> 
